  <!-- EN: sushi soy sauce -->
  <RF_SoySauce.label>寿司酱油</RF_SoySauce.label>
  <!-- EN: It is a soy sauce made by boiling soy sauce, water, sake, mirin, dashi, etc., and is used to soften the strong aroma and saltiness of soy sauce and make the best use of the taste of the ingredients. -->
  <RF_SoySauce.description>这是一种由酱油、水、清酒、味醂、高汤等煮制而成的酱油，用于缓和酱油的浓烈气味和咸味，并最大限度地发挥食材的风味。</RF_SoySauce.description>
  <!-- EN: sushi wasabi paste -->
  <RF_WasabiPaste.label>寿司芥末酱</RF_WasabiPaste.label>
  <!-- EN: A paste made by grinding wasabi rhizomes, which has a strong pungent flavor and is used as a condiment or seasoning. Wasabi used for sushi has deodorant and antibacterial effects against food poisoning. -->
  <RF_WasabiPaste.description>一种由山葵根茎研磨制成的糊状物，具有强烈的辛辣味，常作为调味料或佐料使用。用于寿司的山葵具有除臭和抗菌功效，可预防食物中毒。</RF_WasabiPaste.description>
